  ('equipment-high-risk-flamers', 'ruleset-v5-core-curated-1', 'High-risk Flamers', 'INFANTRY_WEAPON', 'high_risk_arms', 1, 0, 'experimental', 'The Store row 33', 'Source-exact catalogue entry; execution remains gated until its effect handler is implemented.', '{"storeCatalogue":{"storeRow":33,"sourceName":"High Risk Arms - Flamers","sourceSlot":"Primary","rulesText":"Fire Flame Projectors at a hex, Burning it for 2 rounds for base unit damage. Costs 2 FS to attack, solved after attack. Depending on enemy type. Could be Area Denial. If they care about fire damage. When used on infantry inside a structure these weapons ignore any armor given for being inside a structure.","unitAccessText":"Irregular Infantry","effectStatus":"SOURCE_EXACT_HANDLER_DEFERRED"}}'),
