  ('equipment-mini-supply-depot', 'ruleset-v5-core-curated-1', 'Mini Supply Depot', 'ARTILLERY_EQUIPMENT', 'internal', 1, 0, 'experimental', 'The Store row 57', 'Source-exact catalogue entry; execution remains gated until its effect handler is implemented.', '{"storeCatalogue":{"storeRow":57,"sourceName":"Mini-Supply Depot (Artillery Only)","sourceSlot":"Internal","rulesText":"When Deployed you also setup and act as a mini-supply depot that other units can use. Supply Depot allows logi to drop off Supply Crates and store them for others to pick up. This mini-supply depot can reload all forces other then fixed wing aero-space assets unless next to or in the same hex as an airfield. This supply depote is fairly small. Limited 10 Supply Crates Max. These supply crates are lost when the artillery packs up.","unitAccessText":"","effectStatus":"SOURCE_EXACT_HANDLER_DEFERRED"}}'),
